      "theStory": "Ramzan ki ek iftari mein hamari mulaqat Ala Yar Bhai se hui. Polio ki wajah se woh wheelchair istemal karte hain, magar kabhi maangte nahi, sirf mehnat karte hain. Woh subah se raat tak mehnat karke ghubare bechte hain aur apne ghar ka nizam chalate hain. Unki khwahish bas itni thi ke unka rozana ka aana jana kuch asaan ho jaye.\n\nHum ne sab se pehle unke liye ek second-hand three-wheel bike dekhi. Ala Yar Bhai ne khud us par baith kar use chala kar bhi dekha, lekin bike mein kaafi kaam baqi tha aur woh humein unke liye munasib nahi lagi. Is ke baad hum ne mazeed talaash shuru ki aur Ala Yar Bhai aur unke baray bhai ko saath le kar Burewala pohanch gaye. Wahan maloom hua ke is tarah ki three-wheel bikes aam tor par ready-made nahi milteen, balke zaroorat ke mutabiq order par tayyar ki jati hain. Mukhtalif designs dekhne ke baad Ala Yar Bhai ne khud apni pasand ka design select kiya aur advance payment karke bike ka order de diya gaya.\n\nWapsi ke safar mein Ala Yar Bhai ko baar baar gaari se utarna aur dobara bithana mushkil tha, is liye raste mein khana wahin mangwa kar khaya gaya, taake unhein mazeed takleef na uthani paray. Is ke baad Sahiwal pohanch kar unhein unke ghar drop kar diya gaya. Taqreeban 22 se 24 din baad Ala Yar Bhai ki specially tayyar ki gayi three-wheel bike deliver ho gayi. Bike mein self-start, headlights, indicators aur unke asaani se bike par charhne aur baithne ke liye ek khaas folding takhta bhi banaya gaya tha.\n\nAgle din unke rozgar ko mazeed behtar banane ke liye zyada quantity aur mukhtalif designs mein ghubare khareede gaye. Ghubaron ko phula kar bike par sajaya gaya aur peeche ek khaas flex bhi lagwaya gaya, jis par Ala Yar Bhai ka contact number aur sawari se mutalliq paigham likha gaya. Maqsad yeh tha ke log zarurat par munasib kiraya ada karke unki sawari istemal kar saken aur ghubare bechne ke saath Ala Yar Bhai ke liye kamai ka ek aur zariya bhi ban sake. Aakhir mein unhein unki nayi sawari ki mubarak di gayi aur woh khud use chala kar apne kaam ki taraf rawana huay. 15 se 20 saal purani wheelchair par ki jane wali mehnat ka safar ab ek aisi apni sawari tak pohanch chuka tha jo unka safar asaan karne ke saath unke rozgar ko bhi behtar banane ka zariya banegi.\n\nAla Yar Bhai ki sab se khaas baat yeh hai ke jismani mazoori ke bawajood unhon ne maangne ke bajaye hamesha mehnat karke kamane ko tarjeeh di. Woh kisi ke samne haath phailane ke bajaye apne ghubare bech kar izzat ke saath apne ghar ka nizam chalate aaye hain. Is madad ka asal maqsad bhi yahi tha ke unhein sirf waqti sahara na diya jaye, balke aisa waseela diya jaye jo unki mehnat ko asaan kare aur unke liye kamai ke mazeed raste khol sake.\n\n“Aur yeh ke insaan ke liye wahi hai jis ki us ne koshish ki.”\n\n“Kisi shakhs ne kabhi apne haath ki kamai se behtar khana nahi khaya.” “Upar wala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai.”\n\n( Sahih al-Bukhari, Hadith - 2072) ( Sahih al-Bukhari, Hadith - 1429)\n\nAap is haqeeqi kahani ki mukammal video neeche diye gaye link par dekh sakte hain."
