    "location": "Sahiwal, Pakistan",
    "category": "Family Support",
    "excerpt": "Kabhi kabhi raste mein hone wali ek mukhtasar si mulaqat kisi ki poori zindagi badalne ka sabab ban jati hai.",
    "image": "https://abdulmanan.pk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ChatGPT-Image-Sep-12-2026-04_01_24-PM.png",
